    "taglineZh": "一仓双包：stock-sdk（零依赖 · 浏览器 + Node.js）& stock-node-sdk（Node 多源容错 · 财报/快讯/公告）| 完整 TypeScript 类型 | CLI & MCP",
    "taglineEn": "Two packages in one monorepo: stock-sdk (Zero-dep · Browser + Node.js) & stock-node-sdk (Node multi-source failover · financials/news/announcements) | Full TypeScript typings | CLI & MCP"
