  "site": {
    "descriptionZh": "面向浏览器与 Node.js 的全栈股票/财经数据 SDK 家族：提供零依赖双端版 stock-sdk 与多源高可用 Node 增强版 stock-node-sdk，支持多市场行情、K 线、指标、期货、期权、财报、快讯公告与 AI / MCP 集成",
    "descriptionEn": "Full-stack stock & financial market data SDK family for browser and Node.js — zero-dependency stock-sdk and multi-source high-availability stock-node-sdk with quotes, K-line, indicators, futures, options, financials, news, CLI, and MCP"
